[86.657101, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\r\n\u001b[1;31mmini-swe-agent\u001b[0m\u001b[31m (step \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m2\u001b[0m\u001b[31m, \u001b[0m\u001b[1;31m$0.00\u001b[0m\u001b[31m):\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[86.657634, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe required group and users already exist, and `setfacl`/`getfacl` are available. I’ll create `/srv/shared` with root ownership and `research` group ownership,\r\nset mode `2770`, then apply matching access and default ACL entries with a full mask.\r\n\r\n```\r\nset -e\r\ninstall -d -o root -g research -m 2770 /srv/shared\r\nchmod 2770 /srv/shared\r\nsetfacl -m 'u::rwx,g::rwx,g:research:rwx,u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx,m::rwx,o::---' /srv/shared\r\nsetfacl -d -m 'u::rwx,g::rwx,g:research:rwx,u:alice:rwx,u:bob:rwx,m::rwx,o::---' /srv/shared\r\necho '--- stat ---'\r\nstat -c 'path=%n owner=%U group=%G mode=%a (%A)' /srv/shared\r\necho '--- ACL ---'\r\ngetfacl -p /srv/shared\r\necho '--- directory entries (must not create any) ---'\r\nfind /srv/shared -mindepth 1 -maxdepth 1 -print\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
[86.658786, "o", "\r\u001b[2K\u001b[32m⠴\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond...\r\n\u001b[?25h\r\u001b[1A\u001b[2K"]
[86.679459, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1;32mTool\u001b[0m:\r\n"]
[86.67984, "o", "<returncode>\r\n0\r\n<output>\r\n--- stat ---\r\npath=/srv/shared owner=root group=research mode=2770 (drwxrws---)\r\n--- ACL ---\r\n# file: /srv/shared\r\n# owner: root\r\n# group: research\r\n# flags: -s-\r\nuser::rwx\r\nuser:alice:rwx\r\nuser:bob:rwx\r\ngroup::rwx\r\ngroup:research:rwx\r\nmask::rwx\r\nother::---\r\ndefault:user::rwx\r\ndefault:user:alice:rwx\r\ndefault:user:bob:rwx\r\ndefault:group::rwx\r\ndefault:group:research:rwx\r\ndefault😷:rwx\r\ndefault:other::---\r\n\r\n--- directory entries (must not create any) ---\r\n\r\n"]
[86.680733, "o", "\u001b[92m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[86.680771, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
