[101.629484, "o", "\r\u001b[2KVerification succeeded: `alice` and `bob` have rwx access, an unrelated user has no access, and the isolated inheritance test confirmed setgid group inheritance\r\nplus default ACL propagation to both files and subdirectories. `/srv/shared` remains empty. I’ll submit the completed configuration now.\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠹\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
